    class Item5
    {
        dataType="Comment";
		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-8};};
        title="Headless Client Setup (5 slots): HC_1 through HC_5 are vanilla Headless Client Virtual Entities marked Playable - ordinary Arma slot plumbing, not a WMP object; the variable names are for your own reference only, WMP detects a headless client purely by !isDedicated && !hasInterface at runtime. Delete slots you don't need. This alone does nothing: set Waldo_Headless_Enable to true in MissionConfig\\headlessConfig.sqf, then allow-list each HC's IP in server.cfg's headlessClients[] and launch it with -client -connect=<serverIP>. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Headless-Client-Support";
        id=6;
    };
